Package: qore-fsevent-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-fsevent-module-doc
Description: filesystem event monitoring modules for Qore
 This package provides the native filesystem watcher and the FsEventPoller
 and FsEventPollerUtil Qore modules. It includes compiled and source modules,
 compiler metadata, and high-level polling and event handling APIs.

Package: qore-fsevent-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-fsevent-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's filesystem event modules
 This package contains the HTML API references and example tests for Qore's
 native filesystem watcher and Qore event poller modules.
